#: backend.rs:46
msgid "Could not start the system helper."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kuanzisha msaidizi wa mfumo."

#: backend.rs:51
msgid "Could not talk to the system helper."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kuwasiliana na msaidizi wa mfumo."

#: backend.rs:71
msgid "Lost contact with the system helper."
msgstr "Muunganisho na msaidizi wa mfumo umepotea."

#: backend.rs:81
msgid "Authorization was cancelled."
msgstr "Uidhinishaji umeghairiwa."

#: backend.rs:81
msgid "Administrator rights are needed for this action."
msgstr "Kitendo hiki kinahitaji haki za msimamizi."

#: backend.rs:83
msgid "The system helper stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Msaidizi wa mfumo umesimama ghafla."

#: installer.rs:78
msgid "No EFI system partition"
msgstr "Hakuna kizigeu cha mfumo cha EFI"

#: installer.rs:82
msgid "Only {free} free, MAN needs {need}. Make more room with DUHACH! in Windows."
msgstr "Nafasi wazi ni {free} tu, MAN inahitaji {need}. Ongeza nafasi kwa DUHACH! kwenye Windows."

#: installer.rs:83
msgid "No free space. Start DUHACH! in Windows to make room for MAN."
msgstr "Hakuna nafasi wazi. Fungua DUHACH! kwenye Windows ili kuipa MAN nafasi."

#: installer.rs:92
msgid "MAN is running from this disk"
msgstr "MAN inaendeshwa kutoka diski hii"

#: installer.rs:96
msgid "In use: a partition is mounted"
msgstr "Inatumika: kizigeu kimewekwa"

#: installer.rs:98
msgid "Too small, MAN needs {need}"
msgstr "Ndogo mno, MAN inahitaji {need}"

#: installer.rs:108
msgid "Install MAN"
msgstr "Sakinisha MAN"

#: installer.rs:126
msgid "MAN is being installed. Please wait until it finishes."
msgstr "MAN inasakinishwa. Tafadhali subiri hadi imalize."

#: installer.rs:143
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Lugha"

#: installer.rs:155
msgid "_Restart in This Language"
msgstr "_Anzisha upya kwa lugha hii"

#: installer.rs:167
msgid "The live session restarts in the chosen language, and MAN is installed in it."
msgstr "Kipindi hai kitaanza upya kwa lugha uliyochagua, na MAN itasakinishwa kwa lugha hiyo."

#: installer.rs:213
msgid "Welcome to MAN"
msgstr "Karibu MAN"

#: installer.rs:214
msgid ""
"A fast, open and fully customizable GNOME system.\n"
"Install it on this computer, or keep exploring the live session."
msgstr ""
"Mfumo wa GNOME wa haraka, ulio wazi na unaoweza kubadilishwa kikamilifu.\n"
"Usakinishe kwenye kompyuta hii, au endelea kuchunguza kipindi hai."

#: installer.rs:218
msgid "_Install MAN…"
msgstr "_Sakinisha MAN…"

#: installer.rs:220
msgid "_Keep Trying MAN"
msgstr "_Endelea kujaribu MAN"

#: installer.rs:223
msgid "Looking for disks…"
msgstr "Inatafuta diski…"

#: installer.rs:250
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Karibu"

#: installer.rs:265
msgid "This computer was started in legacy BIOS mode. MAN can only be installed on UEFI computers: restart and choose the UEFI boot option."
msgstr "Kompyuta hii ilianzishwa katika hali ya zamani ya BIOS. MAN inaweza kusakinishwa tu kwenye kompyuta za UEFI: anzisha upya na uchague chaguo la kuwasha la UEFI."

#: installer.rs:283
msgid "The system helper returned no disk information."
msgstr "Msaidizi wa mfumo haukurudisha taarifa za diski."

#: installer.rs:348
msgid "  ·  EFI"
msgstr "  ·  EFI"

#: installer.rs:356
msgid "_Next"
msgstr "_Endelea"

#: installer.rs:361
msgid "Installation Type"
msgstr "Aina ya usakinishaji"

#: installer.rs:364
msgid "Erase Disk and Install MAN"
msgstr "Futa diski na usakinishe MAN"

#: installer.rs:365
msgid "Everything on the chosen disk is deleted, Windows included."
msgstr "Kila kitu kwenye diski uliyochagua kitafutwa, pamoja na Windows."

#: installer.rs:365
msgid "Recommended. Everything on the chosen disk is deleted."
msgstr "Inapendekezwa. Kila kitu kwenye diski uliyochagua kitafutwa."

#: installer.rs:369
msgid "Install Alongside Windows"
msgstr "Sakinisha kando ya Windows"

#: installer.rs:370
msgid "Recommended. MAN uses the free space next to Windows; Windows and its files stay. Choose the system at every start."
msgstr "Inapendekezwa. MAN inatumia nafasi wazi kando ya Windows; Windows na faili zake zinabaki. Utachagua mfumo kila unapowasha."

#: installer.rs:377
msgid "Reinstall MAN"
msgstr "Sakinisha MAN upya"

#: installer.rs:378
msgid "Replaces the system but keeps personal files in /home. The current system is saved as a snapshot."
msgstr "Inabadilisha mfumo lakini inahifadhi faili binafsi katika /home. Mfumo wa sasa unahifadhiwa kama picha ya hali."

#: installer.rs:383
msgid "Custom Partitions"
msgstr "Vizigeu maalum"

#: installer.rs:383
msgid "For experts: choose partitions yourself, or create them with Disks."
msgstr "Kwa wataalamu: chagua vizigeu mwenyewe, au uviunde kwa Diski."

#: installer.rs:392
msgid "Disk"
msgstr "Diski"

#: installer.rs:392
msgid "Choose the disk to erase. Disks that cannot be used are shown with the reason."
msgstr "Chagua diski itakayofutwa. Diski zisizoweza kutumika zinaonyeshwa pamoja na sababu."

#: installer.rs:418
msgid "No disks were found"
msgstr "Hakuna diski zilizopatikana"

#: installer.rs:425
msgid "Free Space Next to Windows"
msgstr "Nafasi wazi kando ya Windows"

#: installer.rs:426
msgid "Windows' partitions are not touched. MAN shares the EFI system partition and adds Windows to its start menu."
msgstr "Vizigeu vya Windows haviguswi. MAN inashiriki kizigeu cha mfumo cha EFI na kuongeza Windows kwenye menyu yake ya kuwasha."

#: installer.rs:432
msgid "{size} free"
msgstr "{size} wazi"

#: installer.rs:432
msgid "no free space"
msgstr "hakuna nafasi wazi"

#: installer.rs:437
msgid "{model} (Windows)"
msgstr "{model} (Windows)"

#: installer.rs:456
msgid "Installation to Replace"
msgstr "Usakinishaji utakaobadilishwa"

#: installer.rs:477
msgid "no home folders"
msgstr "hakuna folda za nyumbani"

#: installer.rs:479
msgid "home folders: {list}"
msgstr "folda za nyumbani: {list}"

#: installer.rs:481
msgid "snapshots: {n}"
msgstr "picha za hali: {n}"

#: installer.rs:485
msgid "MAN on {model}"
msgstr "MAN kwenye {model}"

#: installer.rs:499
msgid "Passphrase for {device}"
msgstr "Kauli siri ya {device}"

#: installer.rs:500
msgid "Unlock"
msgstr "Fungua"

#: installer.rs:537
msgid "The installation could not be inspected."
msgstr "Imeshindwa kuchunguza usakinishaji."

#: installer.rs:554
msgid "Partitions"
msgstr "Vizigeu"

#: installer.rs:555
msgid "The system partition is formatted with Btrfs and holds @system, @home and @snapshots. Partitions on the disk MAN is running from are not listed."
msgstr "Kizigeu cha mfumo kinaumbizwa kwa Btrfs na kina @system, @home na @snapshots. Vizigeu vya diski ambayo MAN inaendeshwa kutoka kwake haviorodheshwi."

#: installer.rs:557
msgid "Open Disks to create or resize partitions"
msgstr "Fungua Diski ili kuunda au kubadilisha ukubwa wa vizigeu"

#: installer.rs:559
msgid "Refresh the partition list"
msgstr "Onyesha upya orodha ya vizigeu"

#: installer.rs:567
msgid "Choose a partition"
msgstr "Chagua kizigeu"

#: installer.rs:579
msgid "EFI System Partition"
msgstr "Kizigeu cha mfumo cha EFI"

#: installer.rs:580
msgid "Format EFI System Partition"
msgstr "Umbiza kizigeu cha mfumo cha EFI"

#: installer.rs:580
msgid "Leave off to keep boot loaders of other systems"
msgstr "Acha kimezimwa ili kuhifadhi vipakiaji vya kuwasha vya mifumo mingine"

#: installer.rs:582
msgid "System Partition (formatted as Btrfs)"
msgstr "Kizigeu cha mfumo (kinaumbizwa kama Btrfs)"

#: installer.rs:583
msgid "Boot Partition (needed with encryption)"
msgstr "Kizigeu cha kuwasha (kinahitajika kwa usimbaji fiche)"

#: installer.rs:642
msgid "Partition list refreshed"
msgstr "Orodha ya vizigeu imeonyeshwa upya"

#: installer.rs:650
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Usalama"

#: installer.rs:652
msgid "Encrypt the System"
msgstr "Simba mfumo kwa njia fiche"

#: installer.rs:653
msgid "Protects your data if the computer is lost or stolen. A passphrase is asked at every start."
msgstr "Inalinda data yako kompyuta ikipotea au kuibiwa. Kauli siri inaulizwa kila unapowasha."

#: installer.rs:656
msgid "Passphrase"
msgstr "Kauli siri"

#: installer.rs:657
msgid "Confirm Passphrase"
msgstr "Thibitisha kauli siri"

#: installer.rs:659
msgid "Keep this passphrase safe"
msgstr "Hifadhi kauli siri hii mahali salama"

#: installer.rs:660
msgid "If it is lost, the data cannot be recovered by anyone. The kernel and boot files stay on a small unencrypted boot partition."
msgstr "Ikipotea, hakuna atakayeweza kurejesha data. Kerneli na faili za kuwasha zinabaki kwenye kizigeu kidogo cha kuwasha kisichosimbwa."

#: installer.rs:732
msgid "The passphrase needs at least 8 characters."
msgstr "Kauli siri lazima iwe na herufi 8 au zaidi."

#: installer.rs:734
msgid "The passphrases do not match."
msgstr "Kauli siri hazilingani."

#: installer.rs:748
msgid "Choose a disk."
msgstr "Chagua diski."

#: installer.rs:758
msgid "Choose the disk with Windows."
msgstr "Chagua diski yenye Windows."

#: installer.rs:767
msgid "Choose the installation to replace."
msgstr "Chagua usakinishaji utakaobadilishwa."

#: installer.rs:768
msgid "Unlock the encrypted installation first."
msgstr "Fungua kwanza usakinishaji uliosimbwa."

#: installer.rs:769
msgid "This partition holds no MAN system."
msgstr "Kizigeu hiki hakina mfumo wa MAN."

#: installer.rs:776
msgid "Choose an EFI system partition."
msgstr "Chagua kizigeu cha mfumo cha EFI."

#: installer.rs:778
msgid "Choose the system partition."
msgstr "Chagua kizigeu cha mfumo."

#: installer.rs:780
msgid "The EFI and system partitions must be different."
msgstr "Kizigeu cha EFI na kizigeu cha mfumo lazima viwe tofauti."

#: installer.rs:782
msgid "Encryption needs a separate boot partition."
msgstr "Usimbaji fiche unahitaji kizigeu tofauti cha kuwasha."

#: installer.rs:791
msgid "The system partition must be at least {size}."
msgstr "Kizigeu cha mfumo lazima kiwe angalau {size}."

#: installer.rs:793
msgid "The EFI partition is not FAT formatted; turn on formatting."
msgstr "Kizigeu cha EFI hakijaumbizwa kama FAT; washa uumbizaji."

#: installer.rs:795
msgid "The system partition is mounted; unmount it in Disks first."
msgstr "Kizigeu cha mfumo kimewekwa; kiondoe kwanza kwenye Diski."

#: installer.rs:817
msgid "Where Should MAN Be Installed?"
msgstr "MAN isakinishwe wapi?"

#: installer.rs:824
msgid "Time and Keyboard"
msgstr "Saa na kibodi"

#: installer.rs:829
msgid "Time Zone"
msgstr "Saa za eneo"

#: installer.rs:833
msgid "Keyboard Layout"
msgstr "Mpangilio wa kibodi"

#: installer.rs:843
msgid "Test Your Keyboard"
msgstr "Jaribu kibodi yako"

#: installer.rs:843
msgid "Type here to check that your keys produce the right characters."
msgstr "Andika hapa kuhakikisha vitufe vinatoa herufi sahihi."

#: installer.rs:844
msgid "Type here"
msgstr "Andika hapa"

#: installer.rs:877
msgid "Time Zone and Keyboard"
msgstr "Saa za eneo na kibodi"

#: installer.rs:920
msgid "No disk chosen"
msgstr "Hakuna diski iliyochaguliwa"

#: installer.rs:926
msgid "No system partition chosen"
msgstr "Hakuna kizigeu cha mfumo kilichochaguliwa"

#: installer.rs:928
msgid "The system partition disappeared"
msgstr "Kizigeu cha mfumo kimetoweka"

#: installer.rs:933
msgid "No installation chosen"
msgstr "Hakuna usakinishaji uliochaguliwa"

#: installer.rs:944
msgid "The disk disappeared"
msgstr "Diski imetoweka"

#: installer.rs:955
msgid "Review"
msgstr "Kagua"

#: installer.rs:958
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "Mahali pa kusakinisha"

#: installer.rs:960
msgid "Erase disk and install"
msgstr "Futa diski na usakinishe"

#: installer.rs:961
msgid "Custom partitions"
msgstr "Vizigeu maalum"

#: installer.rs:962
msgid "Reinstall, keeping /home"
msgstr "Sakinisha upya, hifadhi /home"

#: installer.rs:963
msgid "Alongside Windows"
msgstr "Kando ya Windows"

#: installer.rs:969
msgid " (will be formatted)"
msgstr " (kitaumbizwa)"

#: installer.rs:969
msgid " (kept)"
msgstr " (kinahifadhiwa)"

#: installer.rs:970
msgid "System Partition"
msgstr "Kizigeu cha mfumo"

#: installer.rs:970
msgid "{partition} (will be formatted)"
msgstr "{partition} (kitaumbizwa)"

#: installer.rs:972
msgid "Boot Partition"
msgstr "Kizigeu cha kuwasha"

#: installer.rs:976
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Usakinishaji"

#: installer.rs:980
msgid "Space for MAN"
msgstr "Nafasi ya MAN"

#: installer.rs:980
msgid "{free} of free space (a boot partition and the system partition are created)"
msgstr "Nafasi wazi ya {free} (kizigeu cha kuwasha na kizigeu cha mfumo vinaundwa)"

#: installer.rs:981
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: installer.rs:981
msgid "Not changed. It appears in MAN's start menu; the EFI system partition is shared."
msgstr "Haibadiliki. Inaonekana kwenye menyu ya kuwasha ya MAN; kizigeu cha mfumo cha EFI kinashirikiwa."

#: installer.rs:983
msgid "Encryption"
msgstr "Usimbaji fiche"

#: installer.rs:983
msgid "On (LUKS2)"
msgstr "Imewashwa (LUKS2)"

#: installer.rs:983
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Imezimwa"

#: installer.rs:985
msgid "File System"
msgstr "Mfumo wa faili"

#: installer.rs:986
msgid "Btrfs: @system for MAN, @home for your files, @snapshots for restore points. All share the free space."
msgstr "Btrfs: @system kwa MAN, @home kwa faili zako, @snapshots kwa sehemu za kurejesha. Zote zinashiriki nafasi wazi."

#: installer.rs:991
msgid "System"
msgstr "Mfumo"

#: installer.rs:993
msgid "Your Account"
msgstr "Akaunti yako"

#: installer.rs:994
msgid "Created in MAN Setup when the computer starts for the first time, together with the computer name, look and privacy settings."
msgstr "Inaundwa katika MAN Setup kompyuta inapowashwa kwa mara ya kwanza, pamoja na jina la kompyuta, mwonekano na mipangilio ya faragha."

#: installer.rs:998
msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "Kibodi"

#: installer.rs:1002
msgid "All data on {model} ({path}) will be erased."
msgstr "Data yote kwenye {model} ({path}) itafutwa."

#: installer.rs:1002
msgid "_Erase and Install"
msgstr "_Futa na usakinishe"

#: installer.rs:1003
msgid "The chosen partitions will be formatted. Other partitions are not changed."
msgstr "Vizigeu vilivyochaguliwa vitaumbizwa. Vizigeu vingine havibadiliki."

#: installer.rs:1003
msgid "_Format and Install"
msgstr "_Umbiza na usakinishe"

#: installer.rs:1004
msgid "The current system is replaced. Your files in /home are kept, and the old system is saved as a snapshot."
msgstr "Mfumo wa sasa unabadilishwa. Faili zako katika /home zinahifadhiwa, na mfumo wa zamani unahifadhiwa kama picha ya hali."

#: installer.rs:1004
msgid "_Reinstall"
msgstr "_Sakinisha upya"

#: installer.rs:1005
msgid "MAN is installed into the free space. Windows and its files are not changed."
msgstr "MAN inasakinishwa kwenye nafasi wazi. Windows na faili zake hazibadiliki."

#: installer.rs:1005
msgid "_Install"
msgstr "_Sakinisha"

#: installer.rs:1019
msgid "Ready to Install"
msgstr "Tayari kusakinisha"

#: installer.rs:1029
msgid "Erase {model}?"
msgstr "Futa {model}?"

#: installer.rs:1030
msgid "Every file and partition on {path} ({size}) will be permanently deleted. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Kila faili na kizigeu kwenye {path} ({size}) kitafutwa kabisa. Hili haliwezi kutenduliwa."

#: installer.rs:1031
msgid "Erase and Install"
msgstr "Futa na usakinishe"

#: installer.rs:1035
msgid "Format the Chosen Partitions?"
msgstr "Umbiza vizigeu vilivyochaguliwa?"

#: installer.rs:1036
msgid "All data on the chosen partitions will be permanently deleted. Other partitions are not changed."
msgstr "Data yote kwenye vizigeu vilivyochaguliwa itafutwa kabisa. Vizigeu vingine havibadiliki."

#: installer.rs:1037
msgid "Format and Install"
msgstr "Umbiza na usakinishe"

#: installer.rs:1041
msgid "Install MAN Alongside Windows?"
msgstr "Sakinisha MAN kando ya Windows?"

#: installer.rs:1042
msgid "MAN goes into the {free} of free space on {model} ({path}). Windows and its files are not changed."
msgstr "MAN inasakinishwa kwenye nafasi wazi ya {free} kwenye {model} ({path}). Windows na faili zake hazibadiliki."

#: installer.rs:1046
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Sakinisha"

#: installer.rs:1050
msgid "Reinstall MAN?"
msgstr "Sakinisha MAN upya?"

#: installer.rs:1051
msgid "The installed system will be replaced by a fresh copy. Personal files in /home are kept and the old system remains available as a snapshot."
msgstr "Mfumo uliosakinishwa utabadilishwa na nakala mpya. Faili binafsi katika /home zinahifadhiwa na mfumo wa zamani unabaki kupatikana kama picha ya hali."

#: installer.rs:1052
msgid "Reinstall"
msgstr "Sakinisha upya"

#: installer.rs:1057
msgid "_Cancel"
msgstr "_Ghairi"

#: installer.rs:1076
msgid "Installing MAN"
msgstr "Inasakinisha MAN"

#: installer.rs:1077
msgid "Starting…"
msgstr "Inaanza…"

#: installer.rs:1085
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Maelezo"

#: installer.rs:1090
msgid "Installing"
msgstr "Inasakinisha"

#: installer.rs:1103
msgid "Step {index} of {n}  ·  {title}"
msgstr "Hatua {index} kati ya {n}  ·  {title}"

#: installer.rs:1128
msgid "Log"
msgstr "Kumbukumbu"

#: installer.rs:1138
msgid "MAN Is Installed"
msgstr "MAN imesakinishwa"

#: installer.rs:1143
msgid "Restart the computer to start using MAN. A menu at every start lets you choose MAN or Windows; the temporary MAN installer partition is removed by MAN on its first start."
msgstr "Anzisha upya kompyuta ili uanze kutumia MAN. Menyu kila unapowasha inakuruhusu kuchagua MAN au Windows; kizigeu cha muda cha kisakinishi kinaondolewa na MAN inapowashwa kwa mara ya kwanza."

#: installer.rs:1149
msgid "Restart the computer to start using MAN. You can remove the installation media; if it stays connected, MAN still starts from the new disk."
msgstr "Anzisha upya kompyuta ili uanze kutumia MAN. Unaweza kuondoa kifaa cha usakinishaji; kikibaki kimeunganishwa, MAN bado inawaka kutoka diski mpya."

#: installer.rs:1156
msgid "_Restart Now"
msgstr "_Anzisha upya sasa"

#: installer.rs:1171
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Imekamilika"

#: installer.rs:1182
msgid "Installation Failed"
msgstr "Usakinishaji umeshindikana"

#: installer.rs:1186
msgid "No other disk was changed, and the installer has released the target disk. You can review the plan and try again."
msgstr "Hakuna diski nyingine iliyobadilishwa, na kisakinishi kimeachilia diski lengwa. Unaweza kukagua mpango na kujaribu tena."

#: installer.rs:1191
msgid "_Review and Try Again"
msgstr "_Kagua na ujaribu tena"

#: installer.rs:1193
msgid "_Show Details"
msgstr "_Onyesha maelezo"

#: installer.rs:1208
msgid "Installation Log"
msgstr "Kumbukumbu ya usakinishaji"

#: langui.rs:229
msgid "Search languages"
msgstr "Tafuta lugha"

#: langui.rs:269
msgid "Search countries"
msgstr "Tafuta nchi"

#: oobe.rs:165
msgid "The system disk was not found."
msgstr "Diski ya mfumo haikupatikana."

#: oobe.rs:173
msgid "Encryption needs the Btrfs layout created by the MAN installer."
msgstr "Usimbaji fiche unahitaji mpangilio wa Btrfs ulioundwa na kisakinishi cha MAN."

#: oobe.rs:177
msgid "This installation has no separate boot partition, which encryption needs. Reinstall MAN with “Erase Disk” to use encryption."
msgstr "Usakinishaji huu hauna kizigeu tofauti cha kuwasha, ambacho usimbaji fiche unahitaji. Sakinisha MAN upya kwa “Futa diski” ili kutumia usimbaji fiche."

#: oobe.rs:501
msgid "MAN Setup"
msgstr "MAN Setup"

#: oobe.rs:554
msgid "Where Are You?"
msgstr "Uko wapi?"

#: oobe.rs:554
msgid "Your country or region sets the date, time and number formats."
msgstr "Nchi au eneo lako linaamua muundo wa tarehe, saa na namba."

#: oobe.rs:572
msgid "Country"
msgstr "Nchi"

#: oobe.rs:587
msgid "GNU General Public License, version 2"
msgstr "GNU General Public License, toleo la 2"

#: oobe.rs:587
