msgstr "Nimesoma na ninakubali masharti ya leseni"

#: oobe.rs:692
msgid "Wired"
msgstr "Kwa waya"

#: oobe.rs:698
msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "Haijaunganishwa"

#: oobe.rs:732
msgid "Connect to the Internet"
msgstr "Unganisha kwenye intaneti"

#: oobe.rs:732
msgid "Connecting lets MAN set the time and keep your software up to date. You can also do this later."
msgstr "Ukiwa na muunganisho, MAN inaweza kuweka saa na kusasisha programu zako. Unaweza pia kufanya hivi baadaye."

#: oobe.rs:734
msgid "Checking the connection…"
msgstr "Inakagua muunganisho…"

#: oobe.rs:740
msgid "Wi-Fi Networks"
msgstr "Mitandao ya Wi-Fi"

#: oobe.rs:742
msgid "Search Again"
msgstr "Tafuta tena"

